# Claude bio-chem archive

> A Claude conversation archive on the bio-chem / nuclear-roadmap style thread.

## Purpose
Explain this repo as saved talk, not as a lab protocol to run. Source: fitzyracing1/claude-bio-chem.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the chat history in this repo.
2. Use it to recall bio-chem talk.
3. Do not treat the archive as a recipe to mix chemicals.

## Key ideas
- Conversation archive
- Bio-chem thread
- Family of claude-* repos

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/claude-bio-chem
archive = conversation_shelf("bio-chem")
read(archive)
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. conversation_shelf("bio-chem") → “this folder holds that thread”
2. read(archive) → “open the saved talk”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader asks for a how-to for hazardous mixes → refuse methods
- If a reader wants the chat → stay here

## What a person would notice
A boxed research conversation, not a lab sheet.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the archive.
